{"version":2,"sourceHash":"1822d08b1cf0edd0475c92c0afa22fe040cec6e8e632f2e40817de52b7dfdd2e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-21a","no":"EP.21A","tag":"EP.21A · 想不起的名字","title":"想不起的名字","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-21a:1","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi悄悄走出熟睡的房間。關門前，他回頭看了一眼。Yeoni踢開被子，張著嘴睡著。","bg":"library2","tone":"dark","bgm":"neo2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:2","s":"neo","t":"蓋好被子再睡。感冒了，又要怪客服吧。","x":"soft","l":null,"c":{"who":"neo","x":"soft"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-21a:3","s":"n","t":"他用前爪夾住被角，拉到Yeoni肩頭。Yeoni翻了個身，把那隻前爪當枕頭，抱進懷裡。"},{"id":"ep-21a:4","s":"neo","t":"放手。我不是枕頭。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:5","s":"n","t":"Yeoni沒鬆開。Yeongnyangi就這樣趴了許久，才極慢地抽出前爪，塞了一本書進去代替。"},{"id":"ep-21a:6","s":"neo","t":"抱歉。今天這本書代班客服。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-21a:7","s":"n","t":"沒有回答。Yeoni只在夢裡，含糊地說了一句，一星。Yeongnyangi輕輕笑了。"},{"id":"ep-21a:8","s":"n","t":"上樓時，他把肩膀靠在牆上。左爪又不聽使喚了。","sfx":"thud"},{"id":"ep-21a:9","s":"n","t":"他抬起前爪。紅鏽沿著焦痕蔓延。落水之後，鏽每天長出一指節。","im":true,"shot":"close","fx":"metal","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"metal","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:10","s":"neo","t":"遇火燒焦，遇水生鏽。金屬也真難照顧。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:11","s":"n","t":"他用斗篷下襬蓋住鏽跡。明早也不能讓Yeoni看見。雖然摩卡和閏月已經發現，不過那兩人嘴很嚴。"},{"id":"ep-21a:12","s":"n","t":"不對，水獺不嚴。今天下午，那條尾巴，大概什麼都說了。"},{"id":"ep-21a:13","s":"n","t":"雨的氣味從樓梯窗飄進來。貓停住，聞了許久。","bgm":"memWater","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:14","s":"n","t":"雨中的車站。雨水從舊屋簷下，連成線落下。","bg":"rainStop","tone":"desat","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"rainStop","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: rainStop","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"rainStop 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:15","s":"n","t":"一隻小手撐著傘，傘半傾著，偏向身邊的人。"},{"id":"ep-21a:16","s":"n","t":"傘下，有人笑著。淋著雨，傻乎乎的，卻無比開心。","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"rain","scene":{"background":"rainStop","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: rainStop","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"rainStop 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:17","s":"n","t":"「一起撐吧」的聲音混在雨聲裡。直到那聲音遠去，貓一直閉著眼。"},{"id":"ep-21a:18","s":"n","t":"他把額頭抵上冷牆。雨細了，樓梯重新安靜。","bg":"library2","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:19","s":"neo","t":"下雨的日子，腳更沉。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:20","s":"sys","t":"［ 客服通知 · 守護者狀態檢查 · 左前爪鏽蝕 · 進行中 ］","im":true,"fx":"script","sfx":"glitch","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"script","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:21","s":"n","t":"金字在眼前浮起，又消失。客服倒總準時通知這些。"},{"id":"ep-21a:22","s":"neo","t":"知道。不勞特意通知。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:23","s":"n","t":"他抖抖前爪，繼續上樓。通往屋頂的門被風吹得作響。"},{"id":"ep-21a:24","s":"neo","t":"再撐一會。那孩子的評分還只有一星。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-21a:25","s":"n","t":"他看著樓梯窗映出的自己。深藍帽子，泛著金光的紫眼睛，生鏽的前爪。那是戴帽子的貓的臉。"},{"id":"ep-21a:26","s":"neo","t":"那孩子看這張臉，只問是不是普通的貓。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:27","s":"n","t":"隨後打分，一星。那天的一顆星，貓仍記得清清楚楚。"},{"id":"ep-21a:28","s":"n","t":"屋頂上，風很大。被吞去一半的太陽，掛在夜空。那是既非白晝，也非黑夜的天空。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"stillLake","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:29","s":"n","t":"屋頂盡頭，坐著黑虎。彷彿從一開始，就在等他。"},{"id":"ep-21a:30","s":"tiger","t":"上樓的聲音，我全聽見了，貓先生。","x":"base","l":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"tiger","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-21a:31","s":"neo","t":"聞到雨味，過來看看。又來偷誰的書。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:32","s":"tiger","t":"今天不是來工作，是有話對您說。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:33","s":"neo","t":"對豬說話不客氣，對我也不客氣。妳會對誰恭恭敬敬呢。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:34","s":"tiger","t":"請別問無謂的問題。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:35","s":"neo","t":"對帳簿的主人嗎。對那個聲音。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:36","s":"tiger","t":"請閉嘴。那個聲音，現在也一直聽著呢。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:37","s":"n","t":"老虎瞥了一眼天空。半輪太陽的黑色一側，極緩慢地蠕動著。"},{"id":"ep-21a:38","s":"n","t":"老虎的紅眼，落到Yeongnyangi的左爪上。準確地找到了，斗篷下襬蓋住的鏽跡。"},{"id":"ep-21a:39","s":"tiger","t":"那隻腳，每天都會蔓延一節吧。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:40","s":"neo","t":"妳怎麼知道。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:41","s":"tiger","t":"賬上全有。您每在那孩子身邊受傷一次，她那欄就會沉一分。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:42","s":"neo","t":"別動她那一欄。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:43","s":"tiger","t":"動她的是您。她的火越大，您融得越多；您越撐著，她就越小。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:44","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi沒回答。兩人都知道，他無話反駁。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:45","s":"tiger","t":"請離開。現在離開，她還能靠七格活下去。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:46","s":"neo","t":"七格，會變成容器。妳也知道吧。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:47","s":"tiger","t":"您怎麼知道。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-21a:48","s":"neo","t":"就算看不了帳簿，我也會看天。被吞掉的太陽想要什麼，我還是看得出來。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:49","s":"n","t":"雨滴開始落在兩人之間。明明天很晴，只有他們站著的地方下起了雨。","sfx":"rain"},{"id":"ep-21a:50","s":"tiger","t":"您一聞到雨味，臉色就變得奇怪呢。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:51","s":"neo","t":"錯覺。貓本來就討厭溼。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:52","s":"tiger","t":"是嗎？那我也當自己看錯了。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:53","s":"n","t":"老虎的尾巴重重拍在地上。雨水飛濺。","im":true,"fx":"water","sfx":"thud","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"water","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:54","s":"tiger","t":"請別這樣看。我討厭同情，比討厭債還甚。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:55","s":"neo","t":"不是同情。看你的賬本溼了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:56","s":"tiger","t":"賬本總是溼的，我走到哪裡，雨便跟到哪裡。","x":"sad","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 tiger의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-21a:57","s":"n","t":"老虎沒再說，抬爪攥緊頸上的環，儘管那環此刻什麼也沒做。"},{"id":"ep-21a:58","s":"tiger","t":"請別裝作明白，您連賬都看不見。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:59","s":"neo","t":"看不見，所以問。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:60","s":"tiger","t":"我全記得，一點也沒漏，才過著這樣的日子。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:61","s":"neo","t":"所以在那聲音手下做事嗎。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:62","s":"tiger","t":"會長會準確收回債，我要的只有這個。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:63","s":"n","t":"貓的前爪一縮，鏽處驟然灼熱。每次提起會長，鏽便刺痛。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:64","s":"neo","t":"那會長不光收債，也收容器。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:65","s":"tiger","t":"知道。可我還是要收回應收的。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:66","s":"tiger","t":"請別再問，我沒有向貓先生說自己處境的理由。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:67","s":"neo","t":"彼此彼此。我也不知道妳的名字。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:68","s":"n","t":"風吹過。Yeongnyangi眼眸深處，金光驟起，又消失。那道光，連他自己也沒察覺。","im":true,"fx":"veil","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:69","s":"tiger","t":"您現在那個眼神。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-21a:70","s":"neo","t":"別在意。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:71","s":"tiger","t":"空格前也是這種眼神。您是不知道，還是裝不知道呢。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:72","s":"neo","t":"客服不回答私人問題。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:73","s":"n","t":"這時，下方傳來開窗聲。極其小心，卻又像豬會做的那樣，還是有點吵。"},{"id":"ep-21a:74","s":"n","t":"白貓與黑虎同時轉頭。窗框上，掛著一隻粉紅色前蹄。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"door","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
